  "definition_ja": "y = f(x) を x について解いて x と y を入れかえた関数 f⁻¹(x)。f が 1 対 1 のときに存在し、グラフは y = f(x) と直線 y = x に関して対称。",
  "definition_en": "The function f⁻¹(x) obtained by solving y = f(x) for x and swapping x and y; it exists when f is one-to-one, and its graph is the reflection of y = f(x) across y = x.",
  "latex": "f^{-1}(f(x)) = x",
  "spoken_en": "f inverse of f of x equals x",
